{#- The two typefaces are self-hosted under /fonts (see docs/PERFORMANCE-NOTES.md).
    Their @font-face rules live at the top of style.css, so no separate
    stylesheet request and no round trip to fonts.googleapis.com before the
    page can paint. These two preloads are the faces used above the fold on
    every page — they start downloading alongside the CSS instead of after it. -#}
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/jost-400.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/cormorant-garamond-500.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
